# Dark mode is NOT forced here on purpose — see brave-flags.conf for the full
# reasoning. Short version: `--enable-features=WebContentsForceDark` re-tints
# rendered pixels and wrecks sites that ship their own dark theme. The desktop
# advertises dark through xdg-desktop-portal instead (wizard.sh `dark-mode`
# module), so pages serve their own designed dark styling.

--gtk-version=4
--load-extension=@HOME@/.config/qtile/browser-theme

# One renderer per site instead of per tab — see brave-flags.conf.
--process-per-site
